# Summary: imperative mood, <72 chars, reference the ticket (V-###)
# e.g. "Add rubric decomposition parser (V-010)"
#
# Body (optional): plain language, wrap at ~72 chars. Say WHAT changed
# and WHY. The matching entry in context/CHANGELOG.md carries the
# detail; the pre-commit hook checks it exists for code changes.
#
# Rules:
# - One logical change per commit
# - Code commits require a context/CHANGELOG.md entry (local, untracked)
# - Reference tickets as V-### wherever relevant
